+# Tree-sitter grammars
+
+The symbol graph's MVP binary compiles in the following tree-sitter grammars.
+
+| Language | Crate | File extensions |
+|---|---|---|
+| Rust | `tree-sitter-rust` | `.rs` |
+| TypeScript / TSX | `tree-sitter-typescript` | `.ts`, `.mts`, `.cts`, `.tsx` |
+| JavaScript / JSX | `tree-sitter-javascript` | `.js`, `.mjs`, `.cjs`, `.jsx` |
+| Python | `tree-sitter-python` | `.py`, `.pyi` |
+| Go | `tree-sitter-go` | `.go` |
